  "description": "Enhanced C# (or EC#) is a liberalization and regularization of the C# language.\n\n    This package contains the Loyc.Ecs.dll core library, which allows you to parse C# or EC# code and to print out C# or EC# syntax trees as code. If you want to expand EC# macros, you also need the LeMP package. To generate code at compile-time within your project, use LeMP: http://ecsharp.net/lemp",
